{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200770/extras/library_logo_transparent.png?t=1748540068\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Dark Age Asunder</i> is an action rogue-lite bullet heaven where you battle through endless waves of monsters while rebuilding a fallen kingdom. Choose your hero, unlock powerful abilities, gather resources, and restore what was lost - one run at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The world lies in ruins. An evil King and his dark Wizard have razed villages and unleashed relentless monsters upon the land. It\u2019s up to a group of heroes to reclaim the realm by fighting back, rebuilding settlements, and growing strong enough to dethrone the tyrant.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Select Your Hero!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Dark Age Asunder </i>is a <strong>rogue-lite bullet heaven</strong> game. Your character will automatically attack in the direction they are facing. Each character has a different playstyle, allowing you to choose one that fits your preference.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200770/extras/Dark_Age_Asunder_9ijy179vsv.gif?t=1748540068\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Level Up!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you go through each level, a different type of enemy will spawn each minute. Enemies drop <strong>EXP, </strong>or <strong>potions</strong> with temporary effects. When you collect enough EXP, you can select one of three <strong>upgrades</strong> to give your character additional abilities or to strengthen their stats for this run only.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200770/extras/Dark_Age_Asunder_1ZXM1y8mBB.gif?t=1748540068\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gather Resources to rebuild your home!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stand within the bounds of a <strong>Resource Discovery</strong> to claim them. The resources available to capture are <strong>Wood, Iron, Mana, </strong>and <strong>Gold. </strong>Every minute that passes, you receive resources for each <strong>Iron Mine, Gold Mine, </strong>and <strong>Mana Well</strong> Resource Discovery you have claimed. <strong>Wood </strong>is a finite resource and can only be obtained once per Resource Discovery. These resources can be used to build <strong>Structures</strong> that will help you on your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200770/extras/Dark_Age_Asunder_rDhPIjIGv1.gif?t=1748540068\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Come Back Stronger!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After finishing or dying during a level, you have the ability to <strong>Upgrade </strong>your character\u2019s stats permanently in the shop using Gold you have collected while playing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200770/extras/Dark_Age_Asunder_hLXS3I5xYq.gif?t=1748540068\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3200770?t=1748540068","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200770/4df097d9829d24d56482f57798e7b5ac6a5788ad/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748540068","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200770/9db56594f70e919b44ba64e6d9da13bc190caa2d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748540068","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200770/9db56594f70e919b44ba64e6d9da13bc190caa2d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748540068","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing