class=\"bb_tag\">Gather Resources to rebuild your home!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stand within the bounds of a <strong>Resource Discovery</strong> to claim them. The resources available to capture are <strong>Wood, Iron, Mana, </strong>and <strong>Gold. </strong>Every minute that passes, you receive resources for each <strong>Iron Mine, Gold Mine, </strong>and <strong>Mana Well</strong> Resource Discovery you have claimed. <strong>Wood </strong>is a finite resource and can only be obtained once per Resource Discovery. These resources can be used to build <strong>Structures</strong> that will help you on your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200770/extras/Dark_Age_Asunder_rDhPIjIGv1.gif?t=1748540068\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Come Back Stronger!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After finishing or dying during a level, you have the ability to <strong>Upgrade </strong>your character\u2019s stats permanently in the shop using Gold you have collected while playing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200770/extras/Dark_Age_Asunder_hLXS3I5xYq.gif?t=1748540068\" /></p>","developers":["Plutonium Powered"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200770/20641c39c69eca583ebb1935a8dc4fedb6127e4b/header.jpg?t=1748540068","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> TBDTBD<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> TBD<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> TBD MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> TBD<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> TBD<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> TBD<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> TBD</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</stron